  "ruleText": "Vet 303.01 Examination Subjects. Applicants shall be examined in the laws and rules affecting the practice of veterinary medicine in New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #1557, eff 4-1-80; ss by #2294, eff 2-1-83; ss by #2892, eff 10-26-84; ss by #5024, eff 12-4-90; ss by #6450, INTERIM, eff 2-8-97, EXPIRES: 6-8-97; ss by #6481, eff 3-29-97; ss by #7418, eff 12-21-00, EXPIRED: 12-21-08\n\nNew. #9464-B, eff 4-23-09 (from Vet 303.02), EXPIRED: 4-23-17\n\nNew. #12842, INTERIM, eff 8-1-19, EXPIRED: 1-28-20\n\nNew. #13467, eff 12-19-22; ss by #14397, eff 11-23-25, EXPIRES: 11-23-35",
